title: M9_REPLAY_SAFE_START
---
<<declare $replay_probe = 0>>
Replay probe is {$replay_probe}. #line:m9_replay_safe_01
<<vn_bg replay_background>>
Replay background is set. #line:m9_replay_safe_02
<<vn_cg m3_cg>>
Replay CG is set. #line:m9_replay_safe_03
<<vn_clear_cg>>
Replay CG is clear. #line:m9_replay_safe_04
<<vn_show m9_replay_character default center>>
<<vn_expression m9_replay_character replay_expression>>
<<vn_move m9_replay_character left>>
<<vn_facing m9_replay_character left>>
<<vn_scale m9_replay_character 1.25>>
Replay character presentation is set. #line:m9_replay_safe_05
<<vn_hide m9_replay_character>>
Replay character presentation is clear. #line:m9_replay_safe_06
===

